---
/** Vote: an answer on a sheet with its score beside it, between the up arrow the reader chose, filled with ink, and a quiet down arrow. */
---

<span class="cover-sheet cover-line" style="width:196px; padding:12px 16px 12px 10px; align-items:flex-start; --gap:8px">
  <span class="cover-stack" style="align-items:center; --gap:0; flex:none">
    <span class="cover-center" style="width:32px; height:32px"><i style="display:block; width:16px; height:16px; background:var(--color-text-strong); mask:url(data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns=%27http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%27%20viewBox=%270%200%2016%2016%27%20fill=%27black%27%20stroke=%27black%27%20stroke-width=%271.25%27%20stroke-linejoin=%27round%27%3E%3Cpath%20d=%27M7.21%203.15%203.41%207.5Q2.75%208.25%203.75%208.25H5.75v4q0%201%201%201h2.5q1%200%201-1v-4h2q1%200%20.34-.75L8.79%203.15q-.79-.9-1.58%200Z%27/%3E%3C/svg%3E) center / contain no-repeat"></i></span>
    <span class="cover-center" style="height:16px; font-size:14px; font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums">42</span>
    <span class="cover-center" style="width:32px; height:32px"><i style="display:block; width:16px; height:16px; background:var(--color-text-muted); mask:url(data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns=%27http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%27%20viewBox=%270%200%2016%2016%27%20fill=%27none%27%20stroke=%27black%27%20stroke-width=%271.25%27%20stroke-linejoin=%27round%27%3E%3Cpath%20d=%27M7.21%203.15%203.41%207.5Q2.75%208.25%203.75%208.25H5.75v4q0%201%201%201h2.5q1%200%201-1v-4h2q1%200%20.34-.75L8.79%203.15q-.79-.9-1.58%200Z%27/%3E%3C/svg%3E) center / contain no-repeat; rotate:.5turn"></i></span>
  </span>
  <span class="cover-stack" style="padding-top:13px; --gap:8px"><i class="cover-bar cover-bar-strong" style="width:96px"></i><i class="cover-bar" style="width:132px"></i><i class="cover-bar" style="width:112px"></i><i class="cover-bar" style="width:72px"></i></span>
</span>
